    {
      "start": 11.36,
      "end": 21.073,
      "en": "Algorithms that learn from vast amounts of data now support humans in many fields, including medicine, finance, and transportation.",
      "ja": ""
    },
    {
      "start": 21.073,
      "end": 29.491,
      "en": "Diagnostic assistance, self-driving cars, and natural language processing.",
      "ja": ""
    },
    {
      "start": 29.491,
      "end": 34.204,
      "en": "Each application is changing our lives.",
      "ja": ""
    },
    {
      "start": 34.204,
      "end": 40.512,
      "en": "In some industries, automation has already transformed the landscape of labor.",
      "ja": ""
    },
    {
      "start": 40.512,
      "end": 45.753,
      "en": "But rapid technological progress comes with serious risks as well.",
      "ja": ""
    },
    {
      "start": 45.753,
      "end": 50.6,
      "en": "Invasion of privacy, the loss of jobs, the spread of misinformation.",
      "ja": ""
    },
    {
      "start": 60.88,
      "end": 64.46,
      "en": "Our society must face these consequences head on.",
      "ja": ""
    },
    {
      "start": 64.46,
      "end": 68.52,
      "en": "Who bears the responsibility for an algorithm?",
      "ja": ""
    },
    {
      "start": 69.64,
      "end": 74.84,
      "en": "When a self-driving car causes an accident, who is held accountable in court?",
      "ja": ""
    },
    {
      "start": 74.84,
      "end": 79.02,
      "en": "These questions still do not have complete answers.",
      "ja": ""
    },
    {
      "start": 79.6,
      "end": 84.32,
      "en": "Governments around the world have begun to develop regulations for AI.",
      "ja": ""
    },
    {
      "start": 85.96,
      "end": 95.06,
      "en": "The European Union has already established a comprehensive law concerning the ethical use of AI.",
      "ja": ""
    },
    {
      "start": 95.06,
      "end": 98.1,
      "en": "Technology in itself is neutral.",
      "ja": ""
    },
    {
      "start": 102.56,
      "end": 107.8,
      "en": "Whether it is used for an ethical purpose or not depends on our human judgment.",
